    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JHJDWGK4ZWNPW612BGS82K44\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to showcase product ratings in a product block within a campaign or flow email.</p>\n<p>Showing the rating of your featured products in emails highlights product quality and customer satisfaction which can increase click-through rates and conversions.</p>\n<p>Ratings will display as a star symbol with a number out of 5 next to it. The amount of reviews will appear in parentheses if this option is selected. The font style can be adjusted in the email template editor.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32781470498459\" alt=\"\" width=\"655\" height=\"289\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JHJDWGK40QKATA7P4G07S5VD\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>This option to show ratings within a product block is only available in accounts that use Klaviyo Reviews. Learn how to <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/15937542819355\">get started with Klaviyo Reviews</a>.</p>\n<p>If you haven’t already, learn the basics of product blocks, and <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000219092\">how to add a product block to an email</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JHJDWGK4RAHA8SRSCV1F98ZA\">Ratings in a product block vs a review quote block</h2>\n<p>Ratings within a product block allow you to show the average rating and amount of reviews for multiple products. This is different from showing a single product and specific text review using a review quote block. Learn <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/18007373861915\">how to feature reviews in emails with the review quote block</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JHJDWGK4GNG5PM5ZZ2DMN427\">Turn on ratings in a product block</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to any email in Klaviyo (i.e., a flow email, draft campaign email, or email template). </li>\n<li>Drag and drop a product block into the template or click an existing product block.<br>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li>If you created a new product block, select either <strong>Dynamic </strong>or <strong>Static</strong> and choose a product feed or specific products respectively.</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>In the <em>Product details </em>section of the sidebar, check the box for <strong>Rating</strong> to show the star rating for each product in the block.</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Optional: Check the box for <strong>Number of ratings</strong> to show how many customers submitted a rating for the product.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32781470498843\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"374\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JHJDWGK4MKS0YTPC4FKJTZ1F\">Change the appearance of the ratings</h2>\n<p>After turning on ratings within a product block, you can change the following elements of the rating’s appearance:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Font</li>\n<li>Size</li>\n<li>Color</li>\n<li>Letter spacing</li>\n<li>Top padding</li>\n<li>Bottom padding</li>\n<li>Styling (bold, italic, underline, strikethrough)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To modify the appearance of the rating:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click on the product block.</li>\n<li>In the sidebar, scroll down to the <em>Text</em> section.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Rating</strong>.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32781490401179\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"278\">\n</li>\n<li>Change the appearance to however you’d like.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>The color and size of the star is based on the text color and size. The star shape can’t be changed.</p>\n</div>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
